<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Maria F. Guzman</title>

https://fonts.googleapis.com
https://fonts.gstatic.com

https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap

<style>

:root{

--night:#091425;
--gold:#C9A96E;
--cream:#F4F1EA;

}

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{

background:
radial-gradient(circle at top,#14294b,#091425);

color:var(--cream);

font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;

overflow-x:hidden;

}

.stars{

position:fixed;

inset:0;

background-image:
radial-gradient(white 1px,transparent 1px);

background-size:60px 60px;

opacity:.15;

pointer-events:none;

animation:drift 60s linear infinite;

}

@keyframes drift{

from{
transform:translateY(0px);
}

to{
transform:translateY(60px);
}

}

.hero{

min-height:100vh;

display:flex;

align-items:center;

justify-content:center;

padding:60px;

position:relative;

}

.hero-content{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;

gap:60px;

max-width:1400px;

width:100%;

align-items:center;

}

h1{

font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;

font-size:6rem;

font-weight:600;

line-height:1;

margin-bottom:20px;

}

.tagline{

color:var(--gold);

font-size:1.2rem;

margin-bottom:30px;

letter-spacing:1px;

}

.welcome{

font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;

font-size:2rem;

font-style:italic;

margin-top:40px;

}

.photo{

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

}

.photo img{

width:100%;

max-width:450px;

border-radius:24px;

box-shadow:
0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.4);

}

.scroll{

position:absolute;

bottom:40px;

left:50%;

transform:translateX(-50%);

opacity:.7;

font-size:.9rem;

letter-spacing:2px;

}

.archive{

min-height:100vh;

display:flex;

flex-direction:column;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

text-align:center;

padding:120px 40px;

}

.archive h2{

font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;

font-size:3rem;

margin-bottom:30px;

}

.archive p{

max-width:700px;

line-height:1.8;

font-size:1.1rem;

}

.worlds{

padding:120px 60px;

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));

gap:30px;

max-width:1300px;

margin:auto;

}

.world{

background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

backdrop-filter:blur(8px);

padding:40px;

border-radius:24px;

transition:.4s;

}

.world:hover{

transform:translateY(-8px);

}

.world h3{

color:var(--gold);

margin-bottom:20px;

font-size:1.4rem;

}

.academicrex{

position:fixed;

right:20px;

bottom:20px;

background:rgba(0,0,0,.4);

padding:12px 18px;

border-radius:50px;

backdrop-filter:blur(10px);

font-size:.9rem;

}

@media(max-width:900px){

.hero-content{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

}

h1{

font-size:4rem;

}

.welcome{

font-size:1.5rem;

}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="stars"></div>

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-content">

<div>

<h1>María F. Guzmán</h1>

<p class="tagline">
Researcher • Writer • Streamer
</p>

<p class="welcome">
Welcome to my universe.
</p>

</div>

<div class="photo">

https://via.placeholder.com/450x600

</div>

</div>

<div class="scroll">

SCROLL TO EXPLORE

</div>

</section>

<section class="archive">

<h2>
Every world begins with a story.
</h2>

<p>
Research, storytelling, and digital culture come together through exploration, creativity, and community.
</p>

</section>

<section class="worlds">

<div class="world">

<h3>📚 Research Conservatory</h3>

<p>
Research, teaching, publications, conferences, and public humanities.
</p>

</div>

<div class="world">

<h3>✍️ Literary Wing</h3>

<p>
S. Samuels, Arcángel, poetry, fiction, and creative worlds.
</p>

</div>

<div class="world">

<h3>🎮 Digital Culture Hub</h3>

<p>
TuMaestra_, streaming, gaming, digital culture, and community.
</p>

</div>

</section>

<div class="academicrex">

🦖 AcademicRex is nearby.

</div>

</body>
</html>
